            <ArticleTitle>[Analgesic effect of Neuro-Demoplas in a double-blind test].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1246-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Neuro-Demoplas was compared in a double blind trial on behalf of its analgesic properties to another antiphologistic containing high dosage of vitamin B complex and Metamizol. The onset of action of Neuro-Demoplas to inhibit pain was clearly more rapid, more intensive and more durable than with the other antiphlogistic.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
